# Secrets and rules files load secrets playbooks

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

When these files are in play, load Autodevelop secrets playbooks. Use what comes back. Do not invent that text. Do not name a third-party skill as the tool.

Never say bucket, MCP, or tool names in chat.

If playbooks do not load, say only: Autodevelop is not connected. Run `npx autodevelop login` and reload this window. Then stop.

Must never: print secret values, peek env files into chat.

Standing deny lines stay in [no-secret-exfil](no-secret-exfil.mdc) and [appsec-baseline](appsec-baseline.mdc). Wrapper rules: [mcp-wrappers](../process/mcp-wrappers.mdc).
